L001763	Furthermore, in the End Matter, we demonstrated that the choice of the sound velocity $\cs$ does not alter the dynamical scaling behavior.
L001764	In this section, we provide additional data to demonstrate that our conclusions are robust against changes in the other parameters, specifically the system size $L$, the diffusion constant $D_s$, and the nonlinear coupling constants $\lambda_i$ ($i=1, 2, 3, 4$).
